  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *arrastrado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to drag\" or \"to pull along\" (literally or figuratively) — *arrastra la silla* (drag the chair), *arrastrar los pies* (to drag one's feet, also figuratively meaning to be reluctant)",
    "Reflexive *arrastrarse* means \"to crawl\" or \"to grovel\": *el bebé se arrastra por el suelo* (the baby crawls on the floor)",
    "Related: *arrastre* (dragging, trawling), *rastro* (trace, trail — related root)"
  ],
